

FONT(1)             UNIX Programmer's Manual                FONT(1)



NAME
     font - list, load, or revert the console bitmap font

SYNOPSIS
     font [ name | default ]

DESCRIPTION
     With no argument, _f_o_n_t lists the fonts in the font direc-
     tory plus the built-in default, marking the active one with
     an asterisk.  With a _n_a_m_e, the corresponding .FNT file is
     loaded (the name is case-insensitive).  The literal _d_e_f_a_u_l_t
     reverts to the built-in font.

FILES
     /lib/fonts/*.FNT

SEE ALSO
     color(1)

